  m_Name: Journal_JamieLetter
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Jamie.Gameplay.JournalEntry
  title: Jamie's Letter
  body: "Dear Alfie,\n\nI wish you the happiest birthday! \n\nMy travel partner and
    the closest friend I ever had. You have been here for the good and bad times
    and I hope these bad ones will be over soon. I miss our travels and I hope we
    can go to that Machu Picchu trip soon! \n\nAnyways remember to stay true to yourself
    and your dreams! Life\u2019s too short not to pursue your dreams!! \n\nAll the
    best, Jamie"
